There is something truly special about the artisan market at Yoga del Mar Spirit Festival. ✨

Here, island makers, artists, healers and creative souls from Mallorca and Ibiza come together to share their handmade creations and beautiful treasures. 🌿

You might discover jewelry infused with the energy of healing stones, water elixirs, handmade flutes, unique Imperfectos hats - each one crafted from different fabrics and completely one of a kind - or clothing made from organic, natural, high-quality fabrics with beautiful light codes embroidered into them.

You’ll find island-made yoga and beach towels, Ringana and DoTERRA, and beautiful upcycled bags made from recycled sailcloth - giving old sailing materials a whole new life. ♻️⛵️

But the market is about so much more than what you can buy.

It’s where you wander, explore, meet and connect.
Where you sit down with a maker and hear the story behind what they created. Surounded by live music…

This is where the festival breathes. 

